{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217080","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1621708001:0":{"text":"本当にお目が高い！一目でうちで最も高価な商品を選ぶとは！","source_cn":"各位客人真是好眼光，一眼就看中了我们店最重磅最有价值的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x464430F48BD27AB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621708002:0":{"text":"これは数百年の歴史を持つ骨董の鏡だよ。見てみな、この精巧な造り、時の積み重ねが刻んだ傷……すべてが価値を証明している！","source_cn":"这是面有着数百年历史的古董镜。瞧瞧这精巧的做工，这岁月...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0561632B53A54593","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621708003:0":{"text":"しかもただの骨董品じゃない。これは神秘の力を宿す魔法の鏡……そう、<style=\"highlight\">啓示の鏡</style>なんだ！","source_cn":"更重要的是，这可不是普通的古董，而是一面有着神奇作用的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA9CA2509A8720C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621708004:0":{"text":"つまり、これは本物のミラクルアイテムなの？","source_cn":"你是说，这真是一件神奇物品？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65B09284D61524AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621708005:0":{"text":"その通り！この鏡は、<style=\"highlight\">内なる魂</style>との対話を通じて啓示を授け、さらに持ち主の霊性と魔力さえも高めていく秘宝なのだ！","source_cn":"没错！向启示之镜祈祷，就能呼唤<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B666D9022B0E0AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","var